        "text_tNNyqd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With <strong>NADCO® Tapes & Labels, LLC</strong>’s graphic design and prototyping services, we can help bring your innovation and entrepreneurial drive to reality. Our graphic design services are the perfect fit whether you’ve just invented a product or want to market your family’s secret-recipe BBQ sauce, or need a new logo or redesign for an existing product. NADCO® Tapes & Labels, LLC features graphic design expertise from concept to creation to help you create an eye-catching design. Our graphic design team will use their talents and skills to help you get your message across in the most effective way possible.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base"
          }
        }
      },
