        "text_M7cLqM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Let’s take that invention a step further. You’ve decided to market the family BBQ sauce, but need label prototyping services for some sample bottles to show investors and buyers. As a start-up, you can’t afford to invest in labels for thousands of bottles. With NADCO®’s label prototyping services, you can get 10 custom designed, custom printed, custom die-cut labels. Our prototyping services are driven by our digital printing and digital die-cutting capabilities, getting your small prototype runs produced without high volume commitments, plate costs, or die costs. At NADCO®, our graphic design and prototyping services help us partner with our customers to make their dreams become realities.</p><p>Once your dream becomes a success, check out our <a href=\"/pages/custom-printed-tapes\" title=\"Custom Printed Tapes\">flexographic printing</a> and <a href=\"/pages/die-cutting-and-material-converting-services\" title=\"Die Cutting and Material Converting Services\">die-cutting</a> capabilities for high volume orders.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
